WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.336 --> 00:00:04.271
I HAVE FINISHED MY BEDROOM.
I HAVE FINISHED THE OFFICE.

00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:06.240
AND I'M JUST WRAPPING UP
THE LIVING ROOM.

00:00:06.273 --> 00:00:07.641
- OKAY.
- SO YEAH.

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:09.009
- I'LL GET PACK-A-LACKIN'.
- I LOVE IT. I LOVE IT.

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:10.277
- MIND IF I PUT ON
SOME MUSIC?

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:12.412
- I DO NOT. I DO NOT.
- ALL RIGHT.

00:00:12.446 --> 00:00:13.881
I GOT THIS NEW DUBSTEP.

00:00:13.914 --> 00:00:16.149
- UH, DUBSTE--WHAT IS THAT?
I DON'T KNOW WHAT THAT IS.

00:00:16.183 --> 00:00:17.484
- OH, DUDE,
YOU'RE GONNA LOVE IT.

00:00:17.518 --> 00:00:18.485
- OH, COOL.
COOL, MAN.

00:00:18.519 --> 00:00:19.920
[stereo beeps]

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:21.922
[peaceful electronic intro]

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:23.657
OOH, I LIKE THIS.

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:26.560
- WAIT FOR THE DROP.
- I'M SORRY, "THE DROP"?

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:29.296
[thrumming electronic bass line]

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:36.503
♪

00:00:36.537 --> 00:00:37.971
WHAT IS HAPPENING?

00:00:38.005 --> 00:00:39.373
- WHAT?

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:41.108
- WHAT IS THIS?

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:43.076
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU!

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:44.545
[music stops]
- [gasping]

00:00:44.578 --> 00:00:46.280
WHAT IS THAT?

00:00:46.313 --> 00:00:47.514
- THE MUSIC?

00:00:47.548 --> 00:00:49.783
- I'M SORRY, IS THAT MUSIC?
- OH, YEAH.

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:51.251
DUDE, THAT'S THE DUBSTEP, MAN.

00:00:51.285 --> 00:00:52.920
THAT'S MY JAM.

00:00:52.953 --> 00:00:54.421
- WELL, IT'S--
IT'S A LITTLE, UH,

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:56.390
LOUD AND DISORIENTING,

00:00:56.423 --> 00:00:57.824
AND, YOU KNOW,
YOU'RE BEING A LITTLE ROUGH

00:00:57.858 --> 00:00:58.959
WITH MY THINGS.

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:01.361
- ROUGH WITH--
DUDE, YOUR STUFF IS FINE.

00:01:01.395 --> 00:01:02.863
- WHY AM I SWEATING SO MUCH?

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:04.798
- BECAUSE YOU'RE FEELIN' IT.

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:06.900
- IS THAT A GOOD THING?
- YES!

00:01:06.934 --> 00:01:08.168
COME ON, MAN.

00:01:08.202 --> 00:01:09.803
JUST GIVE IT ANOTHER SHOT.

00:01:09.837 --> 00:01:11.705
- OKAY. OKAY.

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:14.675
I WILL.

00:01:14.708 --> 00:01:17.678
[thrumming bass line,
electronic chirps]

00:01:17.711 --> 00:01:25.219
♪

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:36.864
- WHOA, DUDE!

00:01:36.897 --> 00:01:38.565
YOU'RE TOTALLY JACKING
MY FLOW UP.

00:01:38.599 --> 00:01:40.434
- DUDE, YOUR NOSE IS BLEEDING,
AND SO IS MINE.

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:41.668
[gasping]

00:01:41.702 --> 00:01:43.237
- [laughing]
AWESOME.

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:45.272
- IT DOESN'T REALLY SEEM
LIKE MUSIC TO ME.

00:01:45.305 --> 00:01:47.107
- OKAY. WOW.

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:49.142
WALLY GETTING
A LITTLE BIT OLD.

00:01:49.176 --> 00:01:50.310
- NO, DON'T DO THAT.
- ALL RIGHT.

00:01:50.344 --> 00:01:51.478
- COME ON.
- NO.

00:01:51.512 --> 00:01:52.813
DIDN'T REALIZE THAT.
OKAY.

00:01:52.846 --> 00:01:54.715
UM, YEAH, WHAT WOULD YOU
RATHER LISTEN TO?

00:01:54.748 --> 00:01:55.983
I CAN HOOK YOU UP WITH SOME
HOOTIE &amp; THE BLOWFISH,

00:01:56.016 --> 00:01:57.117
IF THAT'S YOUR--

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:58.418
- OH, THAT'S FUNNY.
- IS THAT GOOD?

00:01:58.452 --> 00:01:59.419
WANT SOME COLOR ME BADD?

00:01:59.453 --> 00:02:00.654
- YOU KNOW WHAT?
D--GO AHEAD.

00:02:00.687 --> 00:02:02.256
I DON'T CARE.
I SEE WHAT YOU'RE DOING.

00:02:02.289 --> 00:02:04.358
GO AHEAD AND PLAY IT.
I DON'T CARE.

00:02:04.391 --> 00:02:05.559
BECAUSE I'M NOT THAT OLD.

00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:07.127
I CAN GET INTO IT, OKAY?

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.328
WE JUST--LET'S JUST GET
THIS STUFF PACKED.

00:02:08.362 --> 00:02:10.564
PLAY IT.

00:02:10.597 --> 00:02:13.567
[erratic electronic beats,
mixed sound effects]

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:21.608
♪

00:02:36.456 --> 00:02:37.658
[screams]

00:02:37.691 --> 00:02:38.825
[glass shatters,
car alarm blares]

00:02:38.859 --> 00:02:41.895
- [gasps]

00:02:41.929 --> 00:02:43.997
- I THINK I'M GETTING IT!

00:02:44.097 --> 00:02:45.232
- YEAH!

00:02:45.265 --> 00:02:47.100
HA, HA!

00:02:47.134 --> 00:02:48.836
[laughing maniacally]

